---

<Layout title="Synthetic Court Flooring: Turnkey Solutions for Schools & Clubs | UWIN Floortech" description="Upgrade to certified synthetic court flooring. We provide manufacturer-direct PVC vinyl, acrylic, and PP tiles for sports facilities across India. Get a quote." schema={schema}>
  <Navbar />
  
  <main class="pt-24 pb-16 bg-white min-h-screen">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <h1 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-bold text-[#1E293B] mb-8">Synthetic Court Flooring: Turnkey Solutions for Schools & Clubs</h1>
      
      <div class="bg-blue-50 border-l-4 border-blue-600 p-6 rounded-r-lg mb-10 ai-snapshot">
        <strong>Snapshot:</strong> What is the best synthetic court flooring? Synthetic flooring offers UV stability, point-elastic shock absorption, and all-weather durability. UWIN Floortech provides ITF-certified acrylic and BWF-grade PVC vinyl surfaces engineered for the extreme temperature variations of Indian weather.
      </div>

      <div class="prose prose-lg prose-blue max-w-none text-slate-700">
        
    <h2>The Shift to Synthetic Sports Surfaces in India</h2>
    <div class="ai-snapshot bg-gray-50 p-4 rounded-md mb-6 border-l-4 border-gray-400">
      <strong>Why are schools replacing concrete courts?</strong> Bare concrete courts cause severe joint impact injuries and knee strain. Synthetic court flooring—whether acrylic, PVC, or PP tiles—provides essential shock absorption, slip resistance, and certified player safety.
    </div>
    <p>Indian sports infrastructure is undergoing a massive upgrade cycle. The days of playing on raw asphalt or hard concrete are over. Modern institutions require certified surfaces that protect athletes and meet international federation standards.</p>
    
    <h3>Types of Synthetic Court Flooring</h3>
    <p>We supply and install the three primary categories of synthetic sports surfaces:</p>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Acrylic Court Coatings:</strong> 5-layer and 8-layer cushion systems. ITF-certified for tennis and basketball. Ideal for outdoor hard courts.</li>
      <li><strong>PVC Vinyl Sports Flooring:</strong> High-density, multi-layer indoor flooring. BWF-compliant for badminton, table tennis, and indoor multi-sport halls.</li>
      <li><strong>PP Interlocking Tiles:</strong> UV-stabilized copolymer tiles. Excellent for fast outdoor retrofits over existing damaged concrete.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>Sub-Base Requirements for Synthetic Flooring</h2>
    <p>No synthetic surface can compensate for a failing foundation. For a successful installation, the sub-base must be:</p>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>M20 Grade Concrete:</strong> Minimum compressive strength required to prevent base cracking.</li>
      <li><strong>Moisture Barrier:</strong> A 200-micron vapor barrier must be installed beneath the concrete to prevent rising dampness from delaminating the synthetic top coat.</li>
      <li><strong>Slope for Drainage:</strong> Outdoor courts require a strict 0.8% to 1% slope to ensure immediate water runoff.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>The UWIN Floortech Manufacturer-Direct Advantage</h2>
    <p>Buying sports flooring in India usually involves navigating a maze of regional contractors and IndiaMART middlemen who mark up prices by 25-40% without adding installation value.</p>
    <p>UWIN Floortech eliminates the middleman. We source ITF and BWF-grade materials directly from producers and install them with our own trained crews. You pay for the surface, not the trader's margin.</p>
  
      </div>
      
      <div class="mt-12 p-8 bg-[#1E293B] rounded-2xl text-white text-center">
        <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-4">Ready to upgrade your sports infrastructure?</h3>
        <p class="mb-6 text-slate-300">Get manufacturer-direct pricing with zero middlemen markups. We supply and install Pan-India.</p>
        <div class="flex justify-center gap-4 flex-wrap">
          <a href="tel:+919821648112" class="bg-white text-[#1E293B] px-8 py-3 rounded-full font-bold hover:bg-slate-100 transition-colors">Call +91 98216 48112</a>
          <a href="https://wa.me/919821648112" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="bg-green-500 text-white px-8 py-3 rounded-full font-bold hover:bg-green-600 transition-colors">WhatsApp Us</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </main>

  <Footer />
</Layout>
